  "Progress is monitored throughout the six weeks. The program operates within a clinically informed framework supported by Healthy Mind Specialists, ensuring responsible oversight.": "El progreso se monitorea a lo largo de las seis semanas. El programa funciona dentro de un marco con fundamento clínico respaldado por Healthy Mind Specialists, lo que garantiza una supervisión responsable.",
